# The trigger is independent of its source (CR 113.7a, 608.2). Turn 3 the first Archway returns the Plains. Turn 5 the second
# Archway enters and Bot2 destroys it with Wasteland in response; when its trigger resolves Bot1 returns the first Archway,
# "another Desert" (the second is in the graveyard, the first is not it), and surveils 1: the Island on top goes to the
# graveyard beside the destroyed Archway.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Arid Archway
Arid Archway
Swamp x4
Swamp
Swamp
Island
Swamp x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Wasteland
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Wasteland.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Arid Archway.Play
Bot1.Choose(Plains)
! Bot1.Arrange
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Arid Archway.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Wasteland.Activate(Ability: Destroy; Arid Archway#2)
Bot1.Choose(Arid Archway)
Bot1.Arrange( | Island)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Island; Arid Archway
Bot1.Hand = Arid Archway; Plains; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp
